Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来为您播报世界头条消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非洲在持续干旱的情况下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.74,0:02:28.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为寻觅水源
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生成群的火鹳鸟\N在一夕之间消失的怪现象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.62,0:02:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为油轮漏出的原油\N而让苦无居所的海鸟群
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.52,0:02:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也在不知不觉中全都消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.05,0:02:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…这真的很诡异耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.79,0:02:45.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要说\N它们是被外星人带走的对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种像鸟的外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的想法太幼稚了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人是长得像鱆鱼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:59.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得\N大雄说得也很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(世界候鸟野鸟分布图)\N从这次的共同研究我查到了…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上有很多关于鸟人的传说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.98,0:03:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外型像鸟的人类\N叫做鸟人没错吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N一定是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个古亚述时代的精灵图像…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然身体是人的样子\N可是却有老鹰的头跟翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 埃及神荷鲁斯\N它的脸是老鹰身体却是人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本也有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.01,0:03:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乌鸦天狗很明显的就是鸟人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.48,0:03:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么这些全都是外星人喽？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实话也不能说得这么肯定啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:42.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是说不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.25,0:03:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把这些做完吧…\N鸟人…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要像鸟一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由的在天空飞翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.95,0:05:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人不就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人 我是哆啦哆啦超人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是像鸟的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像鸟的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.56,0:06:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说我不想靠引擎或马达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要靠自己的力量在天空飞翔啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一天终于让我等到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次妈妈要你做事\N你就说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你做功课\N你也说“快拿出法宝来”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次只想轻松不肯吃苦的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:07:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算愿意靠自己的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道\N我期盼这一天期盼多久了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道\N我不能一直这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.09,0:07:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太有骨气了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.89,0:07:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让我靠自己飞起来的法宝\N快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的\N这要靠你自己动手做才对呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.80,0:07:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看\N我就是想做像这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找材料…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.05,0:07:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种东西怎么可能飞得起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是先别浇他冷水…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.95,0:08:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到山上试飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的做得很用心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:24.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…你听我说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.17,0:08:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我要飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好下面先铺好气垫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要多管闲事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好心没好报
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该飞得起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 人类的力量根本就…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我一定要飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别试了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.35,0:09:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他这么认真\N我实在无法阻止他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要用气垫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摆了气垫我反而容易松懈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:38.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…飞起来了飞起来了\N根本没有飞起来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的力量根本就是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.38,0:09:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好想靠自己的力量飞起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我要对你另眼看待了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.88,0:09:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的小哔飞走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它有没有飞到这边来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:58.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.40,0:10:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你在干么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:29.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们快过去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.93,0:10:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是这个方向啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他刚才还闪过小哔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.93,0:10:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.18,0:10:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…鸟吗？\N还是人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.95,0:10:51.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真的是鸟的羽毛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.08,0:10:56.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说…是鸟人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.85,0:10:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会开着这种飞机\N突然从天空冒出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像受伤了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想办法帮帮他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被人发现的话\N一定会引起一阵骚动的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐形喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.10,0:11:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来\N就可以把飞机藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你过来背他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我来背啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.48,0:11:24.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先带他回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.35,0:11:30.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好这会是个大事件喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.49,0:11:34.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来是这个方向没错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事绝对不能告诉任何人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.39,0:12:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人…类…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.03,0:12:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面在吵什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,羽毛？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又开始偷偷的养什么东西…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要怕\N我们不会对你怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的…雪鹅号…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们弄去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪…鹅…号？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的是那架飞机吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把它藏在\N你刚才摔下来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 不会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:39.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快带我去\N雪鹅号藏匿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟糕\N妈妈上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:12:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 哆啦A梦你怎么啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我…好像有点发烧…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.11,0:13:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又好像没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又在玩花样了\N我拿很～苦的药给你吃
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.95,0:13:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你在那里干什么呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…里头什么东西也没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:18.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要检查
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他应该是跑去\N藏飞机的那座山里了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁他还没被发现的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想去哪里啊\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.51,0:13:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然你真的想养鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.61,0:13:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好啊 妈妈绝对不会答应
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 好个独家消息就这么飞了…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天再来找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是有什么东西掉下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫\N这件事也不能让大雄知道喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.51,0:14:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底藏到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得是在这附近呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.66,0:14:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明明有翅膀却飞不起来啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们人类为什么会飞啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:14:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去漆喷雾剂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.56,0:15:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 它在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.06,0:15:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 雪鹅号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…都摔坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来要把这个修理好的话\N可能要花一些时间了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.07,0:15:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我自己来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到现在还不相信我们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.59,0:15:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢均KA大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字叫古斯基啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:35.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不是从宇宙来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是哪里呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…我不能说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:47.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看在飞机还没修好之前
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就暂时先躲在这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟箱型露营胶囊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.61,0:15:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这么小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:56.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看着好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的话视野应该也不错\N就这里好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再设置个随意电梯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本电梯前往鸟箱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.67,0:16:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来里面这么宽敞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实里面并不大啦\N是我们变小了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.01,0:16:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这里的视野好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们为什么会有\N这么不可思议的力量呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.15,0:16:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实真正厉害的\N只有哆啦A梦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿…这也没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.93,0:16:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…飞到哪里去了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.57,0:16:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望它平安无事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你就好好的休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天再来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.19,0:17:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是大家知道我在人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会很惊讶吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没想到\N我会受到人类的帮助…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每次都这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背上有翅膀像鸟的人类…\N还说在屋顶上跑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.23,0:17:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定跟我们\N昨天看到的东西有关连
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许就像太郎说的\N是“鸟人外型的外星人”吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.80,0:17:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这肯定是个劲爆消息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N不行告诉大雄对不对…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 开始动手修理啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨 大家早安
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.85,0:18:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安 昨晚睡得好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.22,0:18:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸亏有你们的帮忙\N我的精神都恢复了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天说好今天要来帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.53,0:18:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机翼坏成这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这个用得上吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我自己做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然看起来快破掉了…\N应该可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.08,0:18:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,固体灯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用它来补强一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 那边帮我扶一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他做得好起劲喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 再右边一点…\N好…可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着修螺旋桨
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.84,0:19:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要扶好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.61,0:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了吗 我要试喽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 去转一下踏板看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 再多转几下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:27.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个就像兄弟一样耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.63,0:19:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 大功告成了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就能飞起来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就来试飞看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.84,0:19:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.94,0:19:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁说有鸟人外星人的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你自己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.95,0:19:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 这不是昨天坠机的残骸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.82,0:19:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还在这附近才对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…是外星人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 别让他逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.89,0:20:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:33.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.40,0:20:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:48.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:49.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 跟昨天一样的洞穴…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.19,0:21:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜可能是时空隧道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空隧道？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.47,0:21:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是普通的鸟耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.71,0:21:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里到底通往哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这样很危险耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,均KA要带我们去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.25,0:21:29.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 这是哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:46.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:01.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你看…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.05,0:22:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这些家伙是什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊 我们穿过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:34.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的竹蜻蜓…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电池没了\N快下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.53,0:22:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.59,0:22:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.87,0:23:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不知道\N绿色的全都任你挑呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.01,0:23:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:13.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母鸡小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.99,0:23:16.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的限时信喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.49,0:23:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.63,0:23:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 是公鸡先生寄来的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点呀 鹳鸟婆婆\N已经快下蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.27,0:23:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:37.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻 鹳鸟是接生婆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.88,0:23:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,塘鹅最适合当邮差先生了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了\N这里就是古斯基居住的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来真的有鸟人世界耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.52,0:23:52.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.36,0:23:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 这几个都是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 这家伙是只猫耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.03,0:24:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真的是猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总算有人认出我是猫来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N现在不是感动的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫是鸟的大敌
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.95,0:24:19.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.66,0:24:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要跑到哪里去才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.59,0:24:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.39,0:24:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶路的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.63,0:24:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.93,0:24:35.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶路的话\N要不要搭驼鸟计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计程车？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.64,0:24:40.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先坐上去再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.67,0:24:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问要去哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.14,0:24:43.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快往前走就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.34,0:24:45.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,避免被甩出去请抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.59,0:24:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太太 您还满意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.92,0:24:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我实在太喜欢这个发型了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.92,0:24:58.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您的光临
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:24:59.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.47,0:25:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么有这么粗暴的计程车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.00,0:25:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是气死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.25,0:25:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 大家排队过马路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.42,0:25:27.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.52,0:25:28.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.96,0:25:31.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过马路的时候要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.23,0:25:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们追上来了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.97,0:25:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就走旁边的小路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.47,0:25:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们往那边跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.24,0:25:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面的路会越来越窄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.04,0:25:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们抓紧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.82,0:26:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,头快弯下去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.30,0:26:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经把警备队甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:13.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.21,0:26:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你们保重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.29,0:26:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经干了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.32,0:26:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来该怎么办哪
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先去找胖虎他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.03,0:26:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好壮观的建筑物喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.87,0:26:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要太过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.54,0:26:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 有人来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:26:58.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲到这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.05,0:27:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么我都不会听的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要每次\N一有人类侵入就找我来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.59,0:27:10.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.56,0:27:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.06,0:27:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 主人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.30,0:27:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唔…好重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.30,0:27:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真搞不懂滋古连度在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.60,0:27:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我应该不会出门了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.85,0:28:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们进去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:09.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许能得到一些情报喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来这里好像是个\N考古学家住的地方耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.12,0:28:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎给我们看过这个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.92,0:28:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像荷鲁斯的像喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话\N很久以前就跟地球有关…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.13,0:28:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:29.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.40,0:28:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么会在这里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.14,0:28:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一路追着你结果就…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.91,0:28:36.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.41,0:28:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类的小孩跟…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.15,0:28:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…一只狸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.18,0:28:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.15,0:28:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一只机器猫
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.39,0:28:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄跟静香\N都是我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的好朋友猫头鹰博士
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又随便跑到\N人类的世界去了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.47,0:29:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 刚才那两个人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.50,0:29:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能被乌鸦警备队抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.19,0:29:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们去啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.86,0:29:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.93,0:29:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你们揍得扁扁的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.20,0:29:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官\N就是这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他们的老大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.71,0:29:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.24,0:29:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么凶暴 的确是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 该怎么处置他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是人类的话那就不必审判
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.45,0:29:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.46,0:29:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,处刑？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么可以随便决定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.53,0:30:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便决定？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.20,0:30:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们人类的一意孤行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.23,0:30:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会造成\N无计其数的鸟类受到迫害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.73,0:30:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就处刑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.20,0:30:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.54,0:30:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.47,0:30:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.74,0:30:16.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.28,0:30:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.01,0:30:22.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦是从人类的世界中\N被隔绝出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.45,0:30:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是隔绝啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.98,0:30:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思是离很远不能往来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.25,0:30:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里跟你们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是由一个叫鸟航道的超空间\N连接起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一个\N是跟后山连接在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是为什么我们不知道呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.26,0:30:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个入口只有\N鸟类跟我们鸟人知道而已
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.94,0:30:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也不会停留在同一个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才一直没有被人发现
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.51,0:30:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.08,0:30:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要赶快想办法\N救救胖虎跟小夫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.51,0:30:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.51,0:30:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 就这样走出去的话\N马上又会被追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.75,0:31:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新型小鸟帽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.52,0:31:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要戴上这个\N我们就可以变成跟鸟人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是鸭子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.23,0:31:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的是天鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔…真是太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可以飞吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.31,0:31:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.84,0:31:24.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.81,0:31:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.58,0:31:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以帮忙带路吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我的雪鹅号又故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.05,0:31:35.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又坏掉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.09,0:31:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我载你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.56,0:31:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N你可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.56,0:31:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.56,0:31:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 这哪飞得起来嘛\N我戴的是企鹅的帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放心 这次我已经换成白鸽帽了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要对我们处什么刑啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.34,0:32:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股打一千下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.85,0:32:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.62,0:32:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别作梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.12,0:32:06.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 你出将军
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.85,0:32:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赢了…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.09,0:32:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沉底球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.16,0:32:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们两个等一下会沉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.89,0:32:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们趁机去拿钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.86,0:32:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.70,0:32:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.80,0:32:20.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就差那么一步
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.64,0:32:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在 快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么搞的\N小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.08,0:32:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:35.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在还没人来 快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.08,0:32:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 原来是你在搞鬼\N给我记住
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.39,0:32:41.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗忘草
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 让你们忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.89,0:32:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们刚才在做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.90,0:32:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见…要保重喔…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受够了 我要回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.40,0:33:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可能还要再多调查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.91,0:33:01.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我不好 害了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.48,0:33:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得能交上古斯基这个朋友\N我们再多待一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.92,0:33:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你叫古斯基啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.65,0:33:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我们两个也有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么责任啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.16,0:33:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得来到这里\N我们就多开开眼界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.59,0:33:23.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N你也给我们那种帽子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.66,0:33:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.20,0:33:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.10,0:33:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈 啄木鸟耶\N太适合你了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.77,0:33:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的是…信天翁耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.44,0:33:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了好了\N别吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.98,0:33:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 胖虎人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.45,0:33:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信天翁都要先助跑才行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.29,0:33:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.69,0:33:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来事情是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.24,0:34:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为什么\N他们一听到我们是人类
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就对我们这么不友善啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.58,0:34:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官\N非常憎恨人类的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.18,0:34:17.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憎恨人类\N为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他曾经被枪打中
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.79,0:34:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦有一支候鸟巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.29,0:34:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的任务是监视世界的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.17,0:34:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟具有特别的能力\N所以不会迷路找不到方向
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.97,0:34:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然其中也会有迷路的候鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.21,0:34:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将这些候鸟引导到正确的航道\N或是保护他们的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.61,0:34:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是候鸟巡逻队的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度就是在巡逻当中\N被无情的人类用枪打中翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.56,0:34:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好过分喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.13,0:35:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那个时候开始\N他就变得相当憎恨人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.23,0:35:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来地球上的鸟类\N跟人类就是要和平共处
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.84,0:35:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要想想\N能为彼此做些什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是我们鸟人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.94,0:35:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或你们人类都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.04,0:35:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士说的一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.01,0:35:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.75,0:35:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别在意
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也知道\N也有像你们这样的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.62,0:35:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们帮助古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.25,0:35:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪鹅号\N是博士跟我一起做出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.56,0:35:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.43,0:35:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实几乎都是\N古斯基一个人完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.43,0:35:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考古学才是我的专长啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.56,0:35:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪这里全都是一些旧东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别碰那个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 吓到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.57,0:35:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个非常古老的石碑\N很容易就会碎掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.61,0:35:54.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这上面刻的传闻\N或许会改变鸟托邦未来的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是去年\N从鸟栖木的根挖掘出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟栖木？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.52,0:36:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.66,0:36:07.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的顶端一直都有云笼罩着
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.13,0:36:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把它叫做“烟环”
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.60,0:36:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到现在还没有人进去过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.91,0:36:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟栖木在我们鸟人诞生的时候\N就一直持续的成长
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 它到底有多高\N顶端上面有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.15,0:36:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.45,0:37:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是我家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:04.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没回家不会挨骂呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.22,0:37:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.25,0:37:08.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是在练习飞行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.09,0:37:10.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.29,0:37:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.46,0:37:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.79,0:37:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你听我说啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.70,0:37:17.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫米露啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.63,0:37:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？是你的新朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.70,0:37:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好 我是住在隔壁的米露
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.17,0:37:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 我们是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把古斯基带出去玩的\N就是你们对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.81,0:37:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去练习开雪鹅号啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.28,0:37:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别找藉口了\N也不跟我讲一声就跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.98,0:37:38.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像是古斯基的女朋友哟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.22,0:37:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错没错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.19,0:37:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真是热闹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.02,0:37:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎古斯基的朋友来家里玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.83,0:37:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就留下来吃晚饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈做的菜很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.37,0:37:55.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 就知道撒娇\N你要多多反省才对
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.34,0:37:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N爸爸人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.37,0:38:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官\N跟巴比伦队长现在刚好来家里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.11,0:38:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度长官在我们家啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能在这份文件上签名
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.59,0:38:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.19,0:38:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了保护我们鸟托邦\N跟地球上的鸟类
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.09,0:38:23.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不被人类迫害的\N最终计划同意书
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.36,0:38:29.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在就剩下猫头鹰博士\N还有你这位环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.24,0:38:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要签了名就能在议会通过
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.64,0:38:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不赞成这个计划
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.24,0:38:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您再考虑清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.21,0:38:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类确实是我们鸟类的劲敌
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.15,0:38:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不能因为这样\N就草率决定
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.26,0:38:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.79,0:38:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是这么会吃
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.73,0:38:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好吃嘛 怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.20,0:39:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.07,0:39:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.20,0:39:02.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.64,0:39:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.47,0:39:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.15,0:39:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一碗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.81,0:39:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.48,0:39:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基也很厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.95,0:39:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我要参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.25,0:39:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不多增强一些体力的话\N那怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.49,0:39:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是伊卡洛斯耐力赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.49,0:39:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.33,0:39:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是以传说中的鸟人\N伊卡洛斯命名的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.20,0:39:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加入巡逻队的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要通过技术速度\N还有持久力的比赛来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.31,0:39:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也会带着雪鹅号参加的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.81,0:39:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你才一直不断的练习
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.52,0:39:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会用翅膀飞的人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.35,0:39:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能在\N伊卡洛斯耐力赛中获胜吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:57.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这未免也太天真了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.86,0:40:00.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之你就多尽力练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.63,0:40:03.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:05.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.16,0:40:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基是有原因才飞不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.33,0:40:08.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也是没有办法的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.03,0:40:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有原因？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.85,0:40:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这样所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.45,0:40:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次当我想用自己的翅膀\N飞看看的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就会想起\N当初那种恐怖的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.09,0:41:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.59,0:41:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从我的耳朵被咬过一次之后
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到现在还很怕老鼠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.89,0:41:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 没关系\N我还有雪鹅号啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.00,0:41:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.96,0:41:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎么说你都是\N靠自己的力量飞起来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然有这个难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.80,0:41:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就一起去帮古斯基加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.37,0:41:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.54,0:41:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.77,0:41:23.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也来参加比赛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.11,0:41:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来满有意思的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.61,0:41:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的要参加啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.11,0:41:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的喽
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.42,0:41:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我决定要参加两卡洛斯耐力赛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.12,0:41:35.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 是伊卡洛斯啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.55,0:41:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它一卡两卡还不都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差太多了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.36,0:41:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就开始练习吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.86,0:41:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 今天晚上早一点睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.50,0:41:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一下好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.07,0:41:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.37,0:41:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 厕所在哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.04,0:41:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.41,0:41:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…下楼之后…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.41,0:42:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.15,0:42:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？我走错了吗…？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.65,0:42:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.12,0:42:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟蛋啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.77,0:42:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了…发生什么事了…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.77,0:42:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇…好可爱哟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长得好像小夫喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.58,0:42:31.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 是个男孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.01,0:42:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是我的弟弟喽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.68,0:42:37.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想怎么样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.13,0:42:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.63,0:42:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓…尼…基…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.40,0:42:55.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果真如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.87,0:43:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…太可怕了…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.47,0:43:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.68,0:43:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我听错了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.05,0:43:16.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定没听错？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.59,0:43:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.59,0:43:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士边看着石碑\N嘴里是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.33,0:43:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的存在终于被证实了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.53,0:43:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.34,0:43:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.64,0:43:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封印在遥远古代\N一股强势的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.01,0:43:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士\N在我还尊他为师的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.11,0:43:43.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就已经投入毕生心血\N从事腓尼基的研究
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.18,0:43:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 要是我们\N能得到这个力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.39,0:43:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是那个顽固的环境长官
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.25,0:43:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是反对我们的人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.02,0:43:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也都对我们束手无策
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.66,0:43:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.23,0:43:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那几个该处刑的人类也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.40,0:44:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 属下该死
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,负责看守的人\N都不记得发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.21,0:44:09.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还求证到\N有另外两个人类跟一只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.08,0:44:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是让人类世界知道\N我们的计划那就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.78,0:44:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快去把他们抓回来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.65,0:44:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.44,0:44:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些从人类世界带过来的鸟\N在这里自由自在的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.08,0:44:47.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有受伤的鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.01,0:44:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就等它们的伤恢复之后\N再让它们回去原来的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.99,0:44:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看那些企鹅好像是\N电视上报导的失踪企鹅耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.46,0:44:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点都没错耶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.76,0:45:00.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是朱鹭耶\N好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.66,0:45:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让一些快要绝种的鸟类繁殖\N再让它们回去人类的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.73,0:45:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是我那个\N身为环境长官的父亲的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.80,0:45:12.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.64,0:45:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 你平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.14,0:45:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.68,0:45:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还以为它跑到哪里去了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.61,0:45:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要开始练习喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.65,0:45:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们听清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.79,0:45:30.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边那个中央厅\N是伊卡洛耐力赛的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.66,0:45:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依照路标飞完一圈\N然后折返
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.59,0:45:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后在鸟栖木的烟环正下方\N插上自己的羽毛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.67,0:45:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.17,0:45:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,途中设置了许多障碍物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.87,0:45:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之速度是最基本的要求
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.87,0:45:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来比赛看谁先飞到\N对面的山崖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.28,0:45:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.98,0:46:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.15,0:46:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.82,0:46:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.09,0:46:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.36,0:46:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.99,0:46:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感觉好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.73,0:46:16.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞的好快喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.11,0:46:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会输呢\N看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.22,0:46:35.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的有够快的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.72,0:46:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度不够快的\N话根本无法获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.03,0:46:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我非参加不可吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.73,0:46:43.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我还是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.26,0:46:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.10,0:46:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 我一定要拿到第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.40,0:46:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.24,0:46:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么大家再飞个十趟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.24,0:46:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十趟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.00,0:47:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有信心 我相信\N明天我一定会获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.24,0:47:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.65,0:47:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.88,0:47:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.88,0:47:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.95,0:48:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.75,0:48:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦最盛大的活动
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.75,0:48:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯耐力赛\N的比赛时间即将到来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.92,0:48:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在中央贵宾席上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.49,0:48:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本大会委员长大老鹰总理\N以及各级长官也都列席参加
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.46,0:48:23.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各个参赛者\N已经都集合在起跑点上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.63,0:48:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.64,0:48:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.77,0:48:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会全力以赴的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.10,0:48:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士好像没有来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.44,0:48:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能正在忙着他的研究吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.28,0:48:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.78,0:48:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要出场比赛啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.55,0:48:47.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为用这个废物\N就可以获胜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.15,0:48:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是你能飞完全程的话\N我服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.56,0:48:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是男子汉的话\N别只靠那张嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家拿出实力来比个高下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.00,0:48:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.16,0:48:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你也要出场比赛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.07,0:49:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还用问吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.37,0:49:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是负责照顾古斯基的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.80,0:49:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.01,0:49:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.01,0:49:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等着瞧好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.71,0:49:10.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让各位久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.04,0:49:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在请大老鹰总理\N来为大家说几句话
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.32,0:49:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在将开始举行伊卡洛斯\N候鸟巡逻队的入队测验
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.80,0:49:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,测验结果的判定\N由巴比伦队长全权负责
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.44,0:49:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了选手以外\N其他人请退出比赛场外
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.38,0:49:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.89,0:49:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,个位选手 请就定位
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.73,0:50:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预备…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.36,0:50:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.58,0:50:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各个选手几乎同时起飞
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.35,0:50:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底谁是第一个飞回来的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.12,0:50:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后在鸟栖木上\N插上羽毛的人又会是谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.64,0:50:43.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.20,0:51:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唉 我已经失去资格了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.98,0:51:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个顽固的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.81,0:51:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不可能获胜的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.62,0:51:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.63,0:51:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好险哪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.13,0:51:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.77,0:51:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.64,0:52:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.41,0:52:59.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.41,0:53:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.79,0:53:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 这里很危险\N赶快离开
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.10,0:53:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经看不到古斯基他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.87,0:53:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.31,0:53:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我翅膀被刚才的蜘蛛丝缠到\N变得不好飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.55,0:53:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.95,0:53:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.25,0:53:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的希望都寄托在你身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.83,0:54:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一组领先的选手已经回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.84,0:54:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着就是要\N一股作气的冲上鸟栖木
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.23,0:54:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.68,0:54:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太奸诈了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.82,0:54:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然用这种道具想要轻松过关
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.90,0:55:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.34,0:55:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝不会认输的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.84,0:55:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时到达
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.84,0:55:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是\N燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.35,0:55:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是\N燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.89,0:55:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.12,0:56:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够优胜实在是太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.29,0:56:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸 古斯基这孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.49,0:56:07.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.44,0:56:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们用最热烈的掌声\N恭喜燕太郎选手跟古斯基选手
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.78,0:56:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且也给参赛选手\N一些鼓励的掌声
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.28,0:56:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.25,0:56:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎跟小夫也尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.29,0:56:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比大雄厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.42,0:56:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一样 大雄太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.96,0:56:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.60,0:56:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的比赛结果有更动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.54,0:56:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在请巴比伦队长为大家发表
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.34,0:56:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如同各位看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.97,0:56:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基选手在这次比赛中\N的确表现相当出色
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.78,0:57:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他的飞行\N并不是靠自己的翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.91,0:57:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是靠其他道具来完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.18,0:57:07.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这种情况下我们可以认定\N他是真正的优胜者吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.85,0:57:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了不让伟大的伊卡洛斯\N的名誉受到屈辱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:14.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们宣布古斯基选手失去这个资格
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.20,0:57:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者就燕太郎选手一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.07,0:57:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.24,0:57:24.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.14,0:57:25.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有搞错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.01,0:57:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.24,0:57:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凡是靠自己的翅膀\N飞完全程的选手
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.88,0:57:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都有资格加入巡逻队的行列
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.81,0:57:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.59,0:57:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠自己的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.64,0:58:02.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.48,0:58:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请原谅我下属的无礼
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.98,0:58:09.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏你多年的研究\N让腓尼基的力量成为我的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.88,0:58:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来所有的一切\N都会照我的预定完成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.12,0:58:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恨的人类啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.19,0:58:17.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.62,0:58:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我复仇的时机来了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.30,0:58:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.13,0:58:27.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一早立刻出动巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.27,0:58:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.89,0:58:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后我还是要\N靠自己的翅膀飞起来才行哪
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.06,0:58:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N你能不能想想办法？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.93,0:58:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这的确是有点难啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.43,0:58:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.53,0:59:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天就要出动了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.43,0:59:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再说啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.80,0:59:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也稍微体谅一下\N古斯基的心情好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.45,0:59:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 把自己关在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.12,0:59:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是让他静一静吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总觉得古斯基\N这次被宣布失去资格的背后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.56,0:59:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么隐情喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.57,0:59:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.07,0:59:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.88,0:59:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.49,0:59:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.96,1:00:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这支新的候鸟巡逻队\N即将执行首次的任务
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.09,1:00:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在什么情况下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.96,1:00:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对要服从命令
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.80,1:00:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.03,1:00:08.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.37,1:00:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都是被挑选出来勇者
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.77,1:00:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在首次任务中\N要尽情发挥你们的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.97,1:00:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟巡逻队 出动
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.90,1:00:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到古斯基了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.26,1:00:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.26,1:00:39.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都没有人看到他
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.93,1:00:41.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.77,1:00:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去猫头鹰博士家找过了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.77,1:00:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.34,1:00:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.07,1:00:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.77,1:00:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士也不在耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.31,1:00:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.28,1:00:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.15,1:00:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根羽毛是警备队的…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.02,1:00:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是博士很很重视的石碑碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.32,1:01:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士一定是在滋古连度长官那里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.02,1:01:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事情 果然是有问题
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.66,1:01:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要先找到古斯基才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.69,1:01:42.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.10,1:01:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.40,1:01:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你们不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.34,1:01:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想自己试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.24,1:01:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么样\N我一定要靠自己的翅膀飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.78,1:01:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.78,1:01:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士被抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.41,1:02:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.38,1:02:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你的好朋友不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.48,1:02:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家同心协力的话\N一定可以把他救出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.12,1:02:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.29,1:02:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:11.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时你还满会讲话的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.36,1:02:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.43,1:02:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基\N你有没有什么线索呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.63,1:02:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许石碑上的文字\N已经解读出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.93,1:02:21.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光包袱
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.63,1:02:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个可以让\N毁掉的石碑再恢复原状
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是能知道上写什么就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.17,1:02:29.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用翻译蒟蒻啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.61,1:02:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.74,1:02:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会把这个法宝给忘了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.55,1:02:36.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译蒟蒻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.38,1:02:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…我知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.95,1:02:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面写什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.02,1:02:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基耸立于北方尽头
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.96,1:02:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉拉亚多山的龙之谷底下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.89,1:02:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙之谷？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.70,1:02:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量\N好比神的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.17,1:02:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假使唤醒腓尼基的力量的话…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.44,1:03:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这里就没了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.54,1:03:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量\N指的到底是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.31,1:03:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.78,1:03:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 这么一来全都明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.28,1:03:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度想要利用\N腓尼基的强大力量
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.48,1:03:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企图将鸟托邦占为己有
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.06,1:03:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告诉伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.42,1:03:21.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯一定会知道\N腓尼基的力量是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.93,1:03:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯不是传说中的鸟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.83,1:03:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是古代的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.50,1:03:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听猫头鹰博士说过…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.74,1:03:31.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他人在监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.58,1:03:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯为了负起
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.31,1:03:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度在候鸟巡逻队时\N遭人类枪击的责任
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.68,1:03:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自愿被关进监狱岛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.46,1:04:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.79,1:04:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.66,1:04:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是伊卡洛斯吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.96,1:04:31.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 请你帮助我们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.47,1:04:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士被滋古连度抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.90,1:04:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年被挖掘出来的石碑上写说
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.24,1:04:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基被封印在龙之谷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.48,1:04:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滋古连度知道之后…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.95,1:04:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯\N请助我们一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.45,1:04:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.98,1:04:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样下去鸟托邦就会…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.63,1:05:09.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快让
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.05,1:05:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个\N赶快过 来抓紧我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.03,1:05:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.90,1:05:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是传说中的羽翼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.28,1:05:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧蒂雅 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.28,1:06:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定要称下去\N加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.56,1:06:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 小宝宝…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.06,1:06:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.27,1:06:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是天空耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:23.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.61,1:06:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在要一口气\N飞到拉拉亚多山
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.78,1:06:28.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.23,1:06:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.59,1:06:44.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量就是\N被封印在这个龙之谷下面
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.60,1:06:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让这股力量重新复活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.33,1:06:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后把人类世界的鸟类\N全都移居到这鸟托邦来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.64,1:06:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从持续破坏环境的人类手中\N把我们的同伴救出来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.38,1:06:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.35,1:07:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫头鹰博士？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.61,1:07:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.11,1:07:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类世界的生态\N就会变得很诡异
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.15,1:07:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟本来就应该跟人类一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.62,1:07:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.39,1:07:12.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你带来这里\N并不是要听你大谈阔论的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.83,1:07:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我这个\N曾经跟你一起研究的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.39,1:07:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分享研究成果也是应该的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.13,1:07:19.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要早点觉醒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.87,1:07:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.50,1:07:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.13,1:07:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 快放开博士
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.77,1:07:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这三个人关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.14,1:07:31.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人立刻把这个山谷的雪铲除
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.01,1:07:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.18,1:07:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.28,1:07:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷喔
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.15,1:07:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.39,1:07:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先降落一下好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.60,1:07:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是山谷的另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.10,1:07:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么法宝快拿出来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.17,1:08:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应变灯
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.14,1:08:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个灯是…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.37,1:08:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了啦\N不用说明
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.71,1:08:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.78,1:08:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 不冷了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.88,1:08:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不可思议耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.01,1:08:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香跟我还有伊卡洛斯\N也一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.65,1:08:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.62,1:08:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯也会冷吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.89,1:08:16.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.39,1:08:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.66,1:08:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧 大雄？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.93,1:08:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好没什么大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.13,1:08:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.17,1:08:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.44,1:08:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是立体影像
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.74,1:08:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫鸟野守\N是二十二世纪的鸟类学者
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.71,1:08:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二十二世纪？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.68,1:08:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌人类的我非常喜欢鸟
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.42,1:08:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我原本想跟小鸟们坐时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.72,1:08:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到哺乳类\N还没诞生的远古时代一起生活
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.51,1:09:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.51,1:09:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为时空乱流\N时光机撞上了超空间的墙壁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.95,1:09:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会来到多元宇宙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.09,1:09:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 我知道了\N原来这里是别的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.03,1:09:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很意外\N不过这也是大好机会
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.36,1:09:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里的话\N不必担心会改变人类历史
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时年轻的我\N如同被恶魔附了身一样…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.47,1:09:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了在这里建造一个鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.51,1:09:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我任意将各种鸟类进化
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.02,1:09:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后我教导鸟人\N所有我所知道的知识
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.56,1:10:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.76,1:10:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基的祖先\N是鸟野博士创造出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.30,1:10:07.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快 不行休息
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.43,1:10:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把这个山谷的雪全都铲平
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.74,1:10:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基的力量是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.07,1:10:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.51,1:10:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么话 还不快做事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.31,1:10:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是鸟托邦也有鸟类的天敌
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最后的工作\N就是要想办法把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.33,1:10:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是我把它引诱到\N这个北端的山谷来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.17,1:10:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始爆破
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.05,1:10:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让它沉睡在这个冰山下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.98,1:11:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经完成了我的工作
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.85,1:11:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦的孩子们记住
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万不可以把腓尼基唤醒过来…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.09,1:11:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来腓尼基\N好像是一头巨大的猛兽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.23,1:11:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快赶过去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.07,1:11:17.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来它就是腓尼基的力量…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.57,1:11:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 要唤醒它吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.48,1:11:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我怎么会没想到呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.88,1:11:29.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以由我来控制它
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.88,1:11:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后再把它\N从鸟托邦送到人类的世界去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.40,1:11:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.67,1:11:50.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我让你再度苏醒过来的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.44,1:11:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你要听从我的指示
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.41,1:11:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个大坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.51,1:11:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.92,1:12:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 给我安静下来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.95,1:12:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.69,1:12:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说中的英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.36,1:12:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.69,1:12:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.13,1:12:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.36,1:12:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.63,1:12:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.97,1:12:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.17,1:12:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.44,1:12:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快抓住伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.94,1:12:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.57,1:12:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吱古连度想要控制腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.41,1:12:33.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企图征服人类世界呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.28,1:12:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会让他得逞的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.71,1:12:36.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这个…\N找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.68,1:12:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化退化放射线源
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.79,1:12:41.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把开关调到退化
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.19,1:12:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你退化成变形虫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.06,1:12:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别管闲事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.96,1:12:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.67,1:12:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.17,1:12:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转到进化去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.67,1:13:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基又急速成长了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.68,1:13:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你要听从我的命令
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.76,1:13:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.83,1:13:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.51,1:13:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.04,1:13:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比伦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.94,1:13:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你照顾一下滋古连度
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.51,1:13:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.79,1:13:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基要去哪里啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.03,1:13:54.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.03,1:13:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,归属的本能\N让它朝鸟托邦的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.80,1:14:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦有危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.53,1:14:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家把力量结合起来\N一起守护鸟托邦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.07,1:14:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也一起加入
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.37,1:14:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.47,1:14:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.08,1:14:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.98,1:14:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.76,1:14:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不要慌乱\N快到山崖上避难
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.90,1:14:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会有这么可怕的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.94,1:14:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够战斗的人快拿起武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.17,1:14:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.81,1:14:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候鸟巡逻队马上赶来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.51,1:14:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战况好激烈喔
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.20,1:15:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快拿武器来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.11,1:15:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是武器\N其实就是我们惯用的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.74,1:15:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮跟休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.54,1:15:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先把腓尼基\N赶出鸟托邦再说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.12,1:15:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.35,1:15:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.35,1:15:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你们用这个\N带小朋友们去避难
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.22,1:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.66,1:15:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听好
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.83,1:15:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万要小心
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.07,1:15:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用 它根本不痛不痒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.84,1:15:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.08,1:15:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.68,1:15:53.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有缩小电筒呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用这个把你缩到最小
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.48,1:15:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防身斗篷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.75,1:16:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.15,1:16:02.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小河
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.69,1:16:03.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.16,1:16:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方应该就安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.16,1:16:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.99,1:16:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我的小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.93,1:16:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 你们在这里等我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.20,1:16:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.44,1:16:20.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样继续下去也治不了它
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.94,1:16:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基 你觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.38,1:16:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.28,1:16:31.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.65,1:16:35.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.53,1:16:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.40,1:16:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你帮了我
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.96,1:16:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.13,1:16:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.23,1:16:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.73,1:16:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.34,1:16:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.71,1:16:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露 静香人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.41,1:17:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.42,1:17:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.92,1:17:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.72,1:17:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基根本就不怕休克枪
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.56,1:17:13.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空气炮也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.19,1:17:15.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有更厉害的武器吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.93,1:17:17.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.66,1:17:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.97,1:17:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟野博士当初坐来的时光机\N或许会有什么武器也说不定喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.57,1:17:30.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把腓尼基引诱出来\N然后把它解决掉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.51,1:17:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.18,1:17:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那台时光机在哪里呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.08,1:17:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对喔
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.88,1:17:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有一个线索
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.52,1:17:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在鸟栖木的最顶端
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.02,1:17:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经穿过云层地带\N很仔细的看过
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.26,1:17:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.19,1:17:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.03,1:17:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.03,1:17:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.53,1:17:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯\N你的翅膀…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.30,1:18:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯你要撑着点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.37,1:18:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.48,1:18:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他大打算去引诱腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.21,1:18:10.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.39,1:18:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.79,1:18:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽量来追我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.90,1:18:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经朝鸟栖木飞去了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.50,1:18:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.07,1:18:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.03,1:18:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是云层地带
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.60,1:19:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.38,1:19:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.55,1:19:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.32,1:19:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.13,1:19:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他们怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.33,1:19:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基一定做得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.20,1:19:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出你的勇气来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.30,1:19:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.90,1:19:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定可以的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.50,1:19:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.61,1:19:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.24,1:19:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.85,1:19:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.88,1:19:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你飞起来了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.32,1:19:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它来了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.62,1:19:57.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄就拜托你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.52,1:19:58.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.39,1:19:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.90,1:20:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种就就跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.11,1:20:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦\N我们要赶快找到时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.55,1:20:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这个时候要用…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.95,1:20:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 就用声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.92,1:20:29.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可行喔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.19,1:20:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,声音凝固剂
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.29,1:20:35.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你快喝下去\N然后大声叫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.43,1:20:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.71,1:20:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.71,1:20:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\N你在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.98,1:20:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.98,1:21:00.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 还好吧？\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.85,1:21:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.85,1:21:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.22,1:21:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到 鸟栖木的顶端\N是个湖泊耶
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.79,1:21:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些水一定是积了好几万年吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.23,1:21:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你看
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.63,1:21:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是鸟野博士的时光机啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.60,1:21:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.14,1:21:23.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大雄他们有没有来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.18,1:21:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.18,1:21:29.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是机舱
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.75,1:21:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望电源没有故障才好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.25,1:21:34.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经荒废二亿年了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.95,1:21:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道还可不可以用
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.23,1:21:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该有设置什么武器才对
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.06,1:21:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会不会是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.47,1:21:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克炮 准备发射
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.20,1:21:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西一定可以打倒腓尼基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.47,1:21:55.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快去通知古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.41,1:21:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.07,1:21:57.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的白鸽帽借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.88,1:22:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.65,1:22:05.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.82,1:22:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 一切都准备就绪了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.69,1:22:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到我的暗号之后\N就要急速上升喔
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.69,1:22:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.99,1:22:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.20,1:22:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.93,1:22:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.04,1:22:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.04,1:22:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.88,1:22:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.92,1:22:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.19,1:22:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.79,1:22:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.13,1:22:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.33,1:22:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你表现得太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.70,1:22:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用自己的翅膀飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来腓尼基就…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.47,1:23:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.84,1:23:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休克枪根本就没有效
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.35,1:23:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讨厌 还不快给我消失
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.85,1:23:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.36,1:23:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让时光机把它带走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.09,1:23:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计时器调到零
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.80,1:23:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.36,1:23:27.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光机开始启动
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.10,1:23:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.35,1:23:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.48,1:23:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次是真的成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.08,1:23:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.78,1:23:49.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是在\N地球还没形成前的宇宙中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.33,1:24:00.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去告诉大家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.10,1:24:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.83,1:24:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要把鸟托邦的大火消灭呢
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.40,1:24:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？要怎么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.14,1:24:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摩西的手杖
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.44,1:24:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先设定好研钵型
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.11,1:24:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.14,1:24:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.31,1:24:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.64,1:24:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.28,1:24:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经被消灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.18,1:24:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.45,1:24:48.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.55,1:24:56.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.59,1:24:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样大火就会灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.39,1:25:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.53,1:25:01.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.83,1:25:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米露
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.46,1:25:04.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这里
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.70,1:25:05.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.03,1:25:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基已经不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.20,1:25:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.47,1:25:12.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 你自己能飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.47,1:25:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.87,1:25:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个时候不知道为什么\N好像听到伊卡洛斯的声音
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.01,1:25:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说“拿出勇气来”
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.92,1:25:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像伊卡洛斯\N附身到古斯基身上呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.72,1:25:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古斯基 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.52,1:25:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你是人类啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.53,1:25:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.53,1:25:39.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.63,1:25:40.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.60,1:25:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.63,1:25:44.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我们没有告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.44,1:25:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.14,1:25:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.11,1:25:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊卡洛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.31,1:25:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.34,1:25:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在等你们回去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.51,1:25:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腓尼基往鸟栖木的顶端\N去了之后就…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.91,1:25:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是人类耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.25,1:26:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人是拯救鸟托邦的恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.02,1:26:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类救了鸟托邦？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.92,1:26:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.56,1:26:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.33,1:26:09.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.09,1:26:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实不只是我们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.36,1:26:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这都是靠古斯基还有大家\N一起努力才能成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.89,1:26:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重建工作也很辛苦喔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.05,1:26:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要大家同心协力\N一定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.79,1:26:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小哔
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.99,1:26:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今以后人类跟鸟类\N也要相互扶持生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.27,1:26:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类也不能依赖鸟托邦\N要努力加油才行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.32,1:27:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明年你就可以用自己的翅膀\N参加伊卡洛斯耐力赛了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.49,1:27:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.02,1:27:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我还要成为一名\N英勇的候鸟巡逻队员
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.53,1:27:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来优胜也是非你莫属喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.10,1:27:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很感谢你们大家
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.33,1:27:23.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不会忘记你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.63,1:27:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就让我们候鸟巡逻队\N送你们去候鸟航线吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.67,1:27:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？小夫他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.61,1:27:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.11,1:27:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没办法带你回去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.68,1:27:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要赶快长大\N然后加入巡逻队喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.75,1:27:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等到那个时候我会再来看你喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.35,1:27:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.19,1:27:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 古斯基
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.56,1:27:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.73,1:27:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会再来看你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.34,1:27:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.07,1:28:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸟托邦
